{"sections":[{"slug":"Poisson流形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Poisson流形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Poisson 流形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形是一个流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备其光滑函数环</span> $C^\\infty(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson代数","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形之间保持</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即满足</span> $\\varphi^* \\{f,g\\} = \\{\\varphi^* f,\\varphi^* g\\}$) <span lang=\"zh\">的光滑映射</span> $\\varphi$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">典范变换</span></strong> (canonical transformation).</p>\n<p>Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的每个光滑函数</span> $h$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span> $C^\\infty(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\{-,h\\}$, <span lang=\"zh\">也即一个向量场</span> $X_h$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">经典力学系统</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">加上一个取定的函数</span> $h \\in  C^\\infty(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/经典力学系统","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">经典力学系统</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">相空间</span></strong> (phase space), $h$ <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> <strong>Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">量</span></strong>. Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">量的中心化子</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">所有满足</span> $\\{f,h\\}=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span> $f\\in C^\\infty(M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成的子代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即所有在向量场</span> $X_h$ <span lang=\"zh\">下不变的函数</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">守恒量</span></strong> (conserved quantities).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">通过典范变换作用于</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">且轨道空间</span> $M / G$ <span lang=\"zh\">仍为流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M/G$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这是一种</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Poisson约化","text":"Poisson <span lang=\"zh\">约化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}